      "title": "The post festum-rationality of history in Georg Luk\u00e1cs\u2019 Ontology",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "\u00c1kos Forczek",
          "openalex_id": "A5061301815",
          "orcid": "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3756-5411",
